<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>DSM details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch petrochemicals group DSM said on Friday it had set its 1996 final alternative stock dividend at one new share per 32 held.</p>
<p>In February, DSM announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 6.35 guilders.</p>
<p>&quot;Based on the closing price of 16 May 1997 of 195.40 guilders, 1/32 ordinary share represents a value of 6.11 guilders, which is 3.8 percent lower than the cash dividend of 6.35 guilders,&quot; DSM said in a statement.</p>
<p>Payment day is May 21, it said.</p>
<p>DSM shares closed up 1.20 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
